# Intake and Planning Governance

- `/generate-brd` output **Draft — Pending Domain Review**. `/plan-sprint` requires BRD **Accepted** or waiver in `docs/harness/decisions.md`.
- `/plan-sprint` output **Proposed — Pending Approval**. Orchestrator refuses implement-* until Approved.
- `/expand-test-coverage` writes `docs/quality/test-package-review.md` as **Pending Approval**. Orchestrator refuses `/run-tests` until human **Approved** or dated waiver in `docs/harness/decisions.md`.
